00ff;\" href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/asbestos-removal\/residential\/\">homes<\/a><\/span> and <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/asbestos-removal\/commercial\/\">commercial buildings<\/a><\/span> still contain asbestos products such as Super Six roofing, fencing panels, insulation and vinyl tiles. We identify these materials, prepare the site and follow strict containment methods to prevent airborne exposure.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t<\/section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\" elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-538f9ce elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"538f9ce\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container container-fluid elementor-column-gap-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1022688 \" data-id=\"1022688\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15dd772 elementor-widget elementor-widget-udesign_widget_heading\" data-id=\"15dd772\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"udesign_widget_heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"title-wrapper  title-left title-md-left\"><h2 class=\"title elementor-heading-title\">Our removal process <\/h2><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64396d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"64396d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We implement a clear and structured process to keep every <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/asbestos-removal\/\">asbestos removal<\/a><\/span> project safe, compliant and stress-free for our clients:<\/p><ol><li><strong>Site assessment<\/strong> \u2014 We start with a thorough inspection to identify asbestos materials and determine the safest method of removal.<\/li><li><strong>Preparation<\/strong> \u2014 The work area is sealed and monitored to keep residents, neighbours and workers protected.<\/li><li><strong>Removal<\/strong> \u2014 Our licensed specialists carefully remove asbestos-containing materials, using approved tools and techniques.<\/li><li><strong>Disposal<\/strong> \u2014 All waste is safely packaged, transported and disposed of at EPA-approved facilities.<\/li><li><strong>Clearance<\/strong> \u2014 Once the site is safe, an independent hygienist provides clearance certification so you have confirmation that the property is asbestos-free.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c45c385 \" data-id=\"c45c385\" data-element_type=\"column\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\" elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-c79663f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c79663f\" data-element_type=\"section\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\" elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-co